  Lines:
  - SpeakerName: Tina
    DialogueText: Maou-Sama, we are nearing the borders of Drakmora. But look ahead!
      A merchant wagon is under heavy attack by bandits.
    PortraitLeft: {fileID: 0}
    PortraitMiddle: {fileID: 0}
    PortraitRight: {fileID: 0}
